[31.756815, "o", "\r\n======== Cover ======== dims=A1:L32 maxrow=32 maxcol=12\r\nK7 'Coal India Ltd.' || cached 'Coal India Ltd.'\r\nK8 'Open Source Financial Model' || cached 'Open Source Financial Model'\r\nB21 'Contact' || cached 'Contact'\r\nB22 'Anil Bains' || cached 'Anil Bains'\r\nB23 'anil@edupristine.com' || cached 'anil@edupristine.com'\r\nI23 '© Neev Knowledge Management - Pristine' || cached '© Neev Knowledge Management - Pristine'\r\nB24 '+91 96196 73853' || cached '+91 96196 73853'\r\nI24 'www.edupristine.com' || cached 'www.edupristine.com'\r\nI25 'info@edupristine.com' || cached 'info@edupristine.com'\r\nB26 'Paramdeep Singh' || cached 'Paramdeep Singh'\r\nB27 'paramdeep@edupristine.com' || cached 'paramdeep@edupristine.com'\r\nI27 '+91 22 3215 6191' || cached '+91 22 3215 6191'\r\nB28 '+91 98929 80608' || cached '+91 98929 80608'\r\nI28 '+91 8080 00 55 33' || cached '+91 8080 00 55 33'\r\nA30 \"Pristine is India's largest authorized training provider for CFA®, FRM®, PRM and Financial Modeling. It has conducted more than 300,000+ man-hours"]
[31.757562, "o", " of finance trainings for individuals and corporates in all the major Indian cities and outside India.\" || cached \"Pristine is India's largest authorized training provider for CFA®, FRM®, PRM and Financial Modeling. It has conducted more than 300,000+ man-hours of finance trainings for individuals and corporates in all the major Indian cities and outside India.\"\r\n\r\nTABLE cells: 0\r\n\r\n======== ReadMeFirst ======== dims=A1:L32 maxrow=32 maxcol=12\r\nA3 'CIL is the largest IPO in India till date. It has generated enormous interest in the investor community (both retail and institutional). Many potential investors want a financial model in MS Excel© which can help them in a thorough analysis of the company. Creating such models have always been a time-taking and daunting exercise.  \\n\\nPristine has created an integrated valuation model based on publically available information. It is available as an open-source model for any user. Kindly note that this model is meant for information purpose only. \\n\\nThe complete"]
[31.757576, "o", " structure of the model and formulas, linkages etc. have been kept open to allow for any modification on the part of the user. Users can use the model freely but should make reference to Pristine while using the same.\\n\\nPristine conducts extensive trainings for financial modeling in MS Excel©. These trainings are targeted towards investors/ professionals who are looking for a career in finance (Investment Banking, PE, Broking, Equity Research, etc.). At the completion of the trainings, the participants should be able to create models like these.\\n\\nFor more information you can contact the authors or Pristine.' || cached 'CIL is the largest IPO in India till date. It has generated enormous interest in the investor community (both retail and institutional). Many potential investors want a financial model in MS Excel© which can help them in a thorough analysis of the company. Creating such models have always been a time-taking and daunting exercise.  \\n\\nPristine has created an integrated valuation model base"]
[31.757585, "o", "d on publically available information. It is available as an open-source model for any user. Kindly note that this model is meant for information purpose only. \\n\\nThe complete structure of the model and formulas, linkages etc. have been kept open to allow for any modification on the part of the user. Users can use the model freely but should make reference to Pristine while using the same.\\n\\nPristine conducts extensive trainings for financial modeling in MS Excel©. These trainings are targeted towards investors/ professionals who are looking for a career in finance (Investment Banking, PE, Broking, Equity Research, etc.). At the completion of the trainings, the participants should be able to create models like these.\\n\\nFor more information you can contact the authors or Pristine.'\r\nI25 '© Neev Knowledge Management - Pristine' || cached '© Neev Knowledge Management - Pristine'\r\nI26 'www.edupristine.com' || cached 'www.edupristine.com'\r\nI27 'info@edupristine.com' || cached 'info@edupristine.com'\r\nA29 \"Pri"]
[31.757589, "o", "stine is India's largest authorized training provider for CFA®, FRM®, PRM and Financial Modeling. It has conducted more than 300,000+ man-hours of finance trainings for individuals and corporates in all the major Indian cities and outside India.\" || cached \"Pristine is India's largest authorized training provider for CFA®, FRM®, PRM and Financial Modeling. It has conducted more than 300,000+ man-hours of finance trainings for individuals and corporates in all the major Indian cities and outside India.\"\r\n\r\nTABLE cells: 0\r\n\r\n======== Disclaimer ======== dims=A1:L32 maxrow=32 maxcol=12\r\nA4 'This open source financial model is for information purposes only. Due efforts have been taken by Pristine and its employees in preparation of this model to ensure that the information is accurate to the best of their knowledge and belief. The primary source of information contained in the report has been the DRHP filing of the company with SEBI. Pristine, makes no representations or warranties regarding the accuracy or c"]
[31.757593, "o", "ompleteness of such information and expressly disclaims any and all liabilities based on such information or on omissions there from.\\n\\nThe analysts who compiled this open source financial model hereby state that the contents in the document reflect his/her/their views and opinions on the subject matter. Pristine, and its employees/ analysts do conduct trainings and from time to time to seek establish business or financial relationships with companies covered in the open research models. As a result, investors should be aware that Pristine and/or such individuals may have conflicts of interests that could affect the objectivity of this report.\\n' || cached 'This open source financial model is for information purposes only. Due efforts have been taken by Pristine and its employees in preparation of this model to ensure that the information is accurate to the best of their knowledge and belief. The primary source of information contained in the report has been the DRHP filing of the company with SEBI. Pristine"]
[31.757596, "o", ", makes no representations or warranties regarding the accuracy or completeness of such information and expressly disclaims any and all liabilities based on such information or on omissions there from.\\n\\nThe analysts who compiled this open source financial model hereby state that the contents in the document reflect his/her/their views and opinions on the subject matter. Pristine, and its employees/ analysts do conduct trainings and from time to time to seek establish business or financial relationships with companies covered in the open research models. As a result, investors should be aware that Pristine and/or such individuals may have conflicts of interests that could affect the objectivity of this report.\\n'\r\nI26 '© Neev Knowledge Management - Pristine' || cached '© Neev Knowledge Management - Pristine'\r\nI27 'www.edupristine.com' || cached 'www.edupristine.com'\r\nI28 'info@edupristine.com' || cached 'info@edupristine.com'\r\nA30 \"Pristine is India's largest authorized training provider for CFA®, FRM®,"]
[31.757716, "o", " PRM and Financial Modeling. It has conducted more than 300,000+ man-hours of finance trainings for individuals and corporates in all the major Indian cities and outside India.\" || cached \"Pristine is India's largest authorized training provider for CFA®, FRM®, PRM and Financial Modeling. It has conducted more than 300,000+ man-hours of finance trainings for individuals and corporates in all the major Indian cities and outside India.\"\r\n\r\nTABLE cells: 0\r\n\r\n======== Assumptions ======== dims=A1:R109 maxrow=109 maxcol=18\r\nR1 'CAGR' || cached 'CAGR'\r\nR2 'Scroll Bar' || cached 'Scroll Bar'\r\nA4 '(Unless otherwise specified, all financials are in INR Million)' || cached '(Unless otherwise specified, all financials are in INR Million)'\r\nF4 =CF!F4 => None\r\nG4 =CF!G4 => None\r\nH4 =CF!H4 => None\r\nI4 =CF!I4 => None\r\nJ4 =CF!J4 => None\r\nK4 =CF!K4 => None\r\nL4 =CF!L4 => None\r\nM4 =CF!M4 => None\r\nN4 =CF!N4 => None\r\nO4 =CF!O4 => None\r\nA5 'P&L Assumptions' || cached 'P&L Assumptions'\r\nK6 21 || cached 21\r\nL6 21 || cached 21\r\nM6 "]
